Thought: The `/potentials/EAM` directory contains a potential file named `Mg_Zhou04.eam.alloy`, which seems to be suitable for Magnesium. I will now retrieve the metadata for this potential file to confirm its applicability for the simulation.
Action: get_potential_metadata
Action Input: {"file_path": "/potentials/EAM/Mg_Zhou04.eam.alloy"}

Thought: The LAMMPS input script for the quenching and relaxation processes has been successfully created. Now, I will run the LAMMPS simulation using this input script to perform the quenching of Magnesium and obtain the final structure data.
Action: run_lammps
Action Input: {"input_file": "/results/2_AUGUST_2025/gpt_4o/react/quenching/workflow/tasks/magnesium_quenching_trial_0/quenching.in"}

Thought: The LAMMPS simulation has completed successfully, and the log file has been saved as `quenching.log`. I will now read the log file to extract the final density of the system, which is required for the task submission.
Action: read_file
